\\begin{aligned}9 & -3 & -1 & 16 \\\\ -8 & 4 & 0 & -15 \\\\ 20 & -1 & 3 & 0\\end{aligned}]" "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}9 & -3 & -1 & 16 \\\\ -8 & 4 & 0 & -15 \\\\ 20 & -1 & 3 & 0\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/cas 17592186243890 :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y,z$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}9x+3y-z=16 \\\\ -8x+4y+0z=-15 \\\\ 20x-y-3z=0\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}9 & 3 & -1 \\\\ -8 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 20 & -1 & -3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}9 & 3 & -1 & 16 \\\\ -8 & 4 & 0 & -15 \\\\ 20 & -1 & -3 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$" "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y,z$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}9x+3y-z=16 \\\\ -8x+4y+0z=-15 \\\\ 20x-y-3z=0\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}9 & 3 & -1 \\\\ -8 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 20 & -1 & -3\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}9 & 3 & -1 & 16 \\\\ -8 & 4 & 0 & -15 \\\\ 20 & -1 & -3 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186243994 :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered ${x}_{1},{x}_{2},{x}_{3}$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}4{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}-3{x}_{3}=0 \\\\ 0{x}_{1}+0{x}_